msgctxt "280"
msgid "Whoa... No way..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "You're not cut out to be a bouncer. Get the hell outta here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "You're no joke... What's your name?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "Kazuma Kiryu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san. Okay, I got it. I'm gonna leave now. Sorry to\r\n"
"have bothered you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid "Um... Thank you very much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid ""
"I'm tellin' you, you really need <Italic>me</Italic> as a bouncer for\r\n"
"this place!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid ""
"This is a dangerous area. You probably have all kinds of\r\n"
"trouble and people gettin' into fights all the time, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid ""
"That's where I come in! I'll jump in and settle things\r\n"
"before they get outta hand. Whaddya say? Sounds pretty good,\r\n"
"don't it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "No, we have the police for that kind of thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid ""
"The police these days don't do nothing! Or are you tryin'\r\n"
"to say you don't think I can do the job!? Are ya!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid "No! I didn't say that!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid ""
"It's a deal, then! I'll watch over this business from now\r\n"
"on. Fifty percent of the profits oughta be a fair wage..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid ""
"Wait. I didn't even answer yet...! And fifty percent of\r\n"
"the profits... Isn't that a bit much?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid ""
"Stop hemmin' and hawin'! It's gettin' annoying! Are you\r\n"
"tryin' to piss me off on purpose!? Are ya!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid ""
"(Not the sharpest tool in the shed, is he... Should I lend\r\n"
"him a hand?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid "(Should I give him a hand?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "544"
msgid "(I don't wanna get involved in this.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid "(Guess I better help...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid "Okay, that's enough. You're clearly bothering them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "580"
msgid ""
"Uh, what did you just say? Just who do you think you're\r\n"
"talkin' to!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid ""
"You. I'm not impressed with the way you handle business...\r\n"
"What family are you from?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "604"
msgid "All right, man, watch this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "616"
msgid "Watch what!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "628"
msgid ""
"The punk rolled up at just the right moment. I'll take this\r\n"
"opportunity to show you my skills. Watch close, now!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "640"
msgid "Okay..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "652"
msgid ""
"Hey, buddy! You're just tryin' to elbow your way in and\r\n"
"make a buck off this business for yourself, aren't ya!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "664"
msgid "What? I'm pretty sure that was your plan here, not mine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "676"
msgid ""
"Hey! Shut your trap! I'm the muscle of this business now!\r\n"
"Butt out!"
msgstr ""

